  "summary": "Malicious code in @or-sdk/contacts (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (`node setup.mjs`) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime and uses it to execute a bundled 727KB obfuscated payload (`math_init.js`) at install time. The payload is obfuscated with a custom string-array decoder and is opaque to inspection; executing a large obfuscated script during package installation is not part of the package's declared contacts-SDK functionality. The package also depends on other packages flagged as malicious. No network endpoint was extractable from the obfuscated payload.",
